    "name": "stencil_2d_centered",
    "description": "A 2-D five-point Laplacian of u on a 9 x 7 grid, periodic in x through EXPLICIT wrap regions (cell 1 reads u[9, j], cell 9 reads u[1, j]) and zero-ghost in y; v is a centered y-difference of itself plus a pointwise read of u. Halo: u (1, 1) along x and y; v (0, 0) along x, (1, 1) along y.",
